            <ArticleTitle>Nocardia asiatica visiting Belgium: nocardiosis in a immunocompetent patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>425-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of a 57-year-old lady presenting with a Nocardia asiatica infection in Belgium. No predisposing conditions were found except for an underlying asthma. We reviewed the literature and discussed the role of linezolid in the treatment of nocardiosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
